<title>USA: N.Y. $123 mln Mortgage Agency bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>N.Y. $123 mln Mortgage Agency bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. said Tuesday it repriced and restructured New York Mortgage Agency's $122.7 million bond deal, raising the top yield in 2027 to 6.125 percent from 6.10 percent.</p>
